  "description": "## 💀♞ Forgotten Knights ♞💀\n\nFight. Heal. Repeat - Forgotten&#039;s Dedicated Assault Subsidiary \n \n### ✨ Features\n- Active main guild (Once you reach cl lvl 100 you can join it)\n- Selfmade world boss timer via discord\n- Guild armory\n- Dedicated pool &amp; assault guild\n\n### ✔️ Requirements\n- **Already be in Forgotten**\n- Help fulfill challenges &amp; stockpile for regular assaults\n\n ### 💬 Discord\n- Join our discord server to apply, get news &amp; information and chat with us: https://discord.gg/kCKdJmckxC\n\n ### 🏰 Other Forgotten Guilds\n- Forgotten CL 100+\n- Forgotten Watch CL 92+\n- Forgotten Vanguard CL 80 - 91\n- Forgotten Dawn CL 60 - 79\n- Forgotten Order CL 25 - 59\n- Forgotten Tavern (Pool Guild)",
